    <cfr:chunkId>404.707</cfr:chunkId>
    <cfr:sourceQuote>opies of original records or extracts from records if they are certified as true and exact copies by— (1) The official custodian of the record; (2) A Social Security Administration employee authorized to certify copies; (3) A Veterans</cfr:sourceQuote>
